		<P CLASS="ParaOverride-5" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;margin-left:48pt;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-indent:-24pt;widows:2;margin-top:8pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">9.<FONT STYLE="width: 20px;display: inline-block;">&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;</FONT>&#x201c;It is resolved as a special resolution that, subject to and immediately following the Share Consolidation being effected, the Company adopt an amended and restated memorandum of association in substitution for, and to the exclusion of, the Company&#x2019;s then existing memorandum of association, to reflect the Share Consolidation (the &#x201c;</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">Sixth</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> </FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">Amendment and Restatement of the MoA</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">&#x201d;)&#x201d;</FONT></P>
